        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-87003, Mod Hex Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Hex Appliance Pull takes its namesake's shape, offering a unique, yet contemporary look. This Mod Hex Refrigerator Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from an array of popular finishes. The Urban Modern Mod Hex Appliance Pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a 3/4 inch appliance panel--making it a great way to update your kitchen's refrigerator handle to show off your style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-hex-cabinet-knob-emtek-86457\"><b>Modern Hex Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/modern-hex-cabinet-pull-emtek-86459\"><b>Modern Hex Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/modern-hex-thru-bolt-pull-emtek-87003\"><b>Modern Hex Thru-Bolt Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Hex Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87003-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Emtek Hex Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-87003:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-87004:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
